  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Slice onion. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Slice cucumber into thin sticks. Grate carrot.\n• In a large bowl, combine carrot and salad leaves. Drizzle with white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/611357ee206e726d2230717d/step-eab239cd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion until softened, 3-4 mins. Stir in garlic and butter and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/611357ee206e726d2230717d/step-8e77f284.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut haloumi into 1cm slices. In a medium bowl, combine haloumi, Persian spice blend (see ingredients) and a drizzle of olive oil. Toss to coat.\n• Wipe out the frying pan and heat over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side. Drizzle with honey and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/611357ee206e726d2230717d/step-81b11829.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, microwave flour tortillas on a plate for 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• Build tacos by spreading a layer of mayonnaise on each tortilla.\n• Top with salad, onion, cucumber and haloumi to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/611357ee206e726d2230717d/step-307ab25f.jpg"
    }
  ]
